held premier league results with 3 outputs (Home, Draw, Away) and contained \
data up to and including the 25/26 campaign. The website is also great for \
getting more data on previous seasons to adjust our neural network.\nAmount \
of examples: Still yet to be decided, depends on how many seasons we end up \
doing\n\nWebsite -> https://datahub.io/football/english-premier-league\n\n",
